GH issue: https://github.com/clankercode/lsp-openplanet/issues/59 (gh-59)

Verified still open 2026-08-24 @ 728c30d: `openplanet-lsp typedb status` →
"unknown command: typedb"; no `src/cli/typedb_cmd.rs`, no `TypeDbMeta`.

## DECISIONS (do not re-litigate)

1. **Implement the existing plan verbatim**:
   `./.hermes/plans/2026-08-23_202335-gh59-typedb-refresh-pipeline.md` — 7 tasks,
   IGC-selected survivor I1 (local-harvest pipeline:
   `typedb status|diff|refresh` + just recipes + CI shape guard + version
   surfacing in check output and server init log).
2. The plan's **premise corrections stand** and must be posted on the issue at
   close-out: the fixture DB is NOT stale (byte-parity with the live 1.29.5
   install), `Draw::GetWidth` was never in any DB (that family belongs to
   `removed_api_hint`), and user-side freshness already works via GH #45
   auto-detect. What #59 actually buys is visibility + a maintainer pipeline +
   an anti-drift guard.
3. **No network anywhere** (plan G3): harvest from a local install via `--from`,
   never fetch. CI only shape-guards the fixtures.
4. **`refresh` is dry-run by default**; `--yes` required to write, `--into`
   always explicit (never an implicit default write path).
5. **JSON report change is additive** (`"typedb": {"op":…, "mp":…}`); verify no
   existing test asserts an exact key set before shipping.
6. **Deferred (record in the close-out comment)**: per-game-version DB selection
   (plan idea I6) — YAGNI until multi-install parity testing is real.

## Test plan
Per plan, red→green per task: `TypeDbMeta::probe` unit variants (Core shape, Next
shape, missing fields, malformed JSON, missing file); `tests/cli_typedb_tests.rs`
integration for status/diff/refresh incl. dry-run-writes-nothing, idempotent
second `--yes`, corrupt file exit 1, missing install warning; shape-guard
rejecting truncated/empty/op-less copies; help-surface test.

## Verification gate
`cargo test --locked` green; clippy `^src.*warning` count <= 53 baseline; FP
fixtures byte-stable (tm-editor-plus-plus = 2 errors, tm-dips-plus-plus = 1);
`just typedb-refresh` dry run reports 0 added / 0 removed / 0 changed against the
live install.

## Lane
Lane C (parallel). Files: src/typedb/index.rs, src/cli/typedb_cmd.rs (new),
src/cli/mod.rs, src/main.rs, src/server/mod.rs, justfile, .github/workflows/ci.yml,
